  "body": {
    "id": "prop:four-label-current-enclosure",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "For \\(\\mathfrak G_4\\) at \\(r=2\\), the exhibited rule \\(Q_{49/25}\\) is globally \\(0.95\\)-honest because \\(2\\Phi(-49/25)<0.049995791\\), and \\(\\sup_{h\\in H_2}E_h\\ell\\{Q_{49/25}(W)\\}<3/4+\\arctan(\\sqrt{3/10})/(2\\pi)-\\{\\Phi(1/25)-1/2\\}<0.813799\\). The exact atomic dual value \\(L_4\\) generated by \\(\\beta_4\\) and \\(\\nu_4\\) exceeds \\(0.361100\\); its whole-line scalar reduction charges less than \\(3753/10^{15}\\) for replacing the optimizing multiplier by \\(\\lambda_4\\). At \\(r=0\\), common-contact coverage implies risk at least \\(14/15\\), and \\(K_{\\mathrm{ct}}\\) attains \\(14/15\\).",
    "free_symbols": [
      "Gfour",
      "Vfour",
      "Ffour",
      "qFour",
